      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Coonan Property present a unique opportunity to own a spacious residence on approx. 19.5 acres of land, located just 3km from Celbridge town centre \n•Woodview offers a rare opportunity to own a substantial land holding so close to transport links, Celbridge and all local amenities\n• The residence extends to approx. 195 sq.m and comprises entrance hallway, living room, study/playroom, open plan kitchen/dining area, utility room, four double bedrooms and two bathrooms\n•The land is accessible through the house and by a second entrance which leads directly into a hard surface yard with two large sheds, suitable for farming, machinery or conversion to equestrian use\n•Just a short 5 minutes from highly regarded local schools in both Ardclough and Celbridge and just 2.5kmm from Hazelhatch Train Station for easy commuting\n•Located just minutes from the M7 and M4 motorways with easy access into Celbridge, Straffan, Maynooth, Naas and Dublin\n•A fine family home offering rural privacy and tranquillity and within easy reach of all local amenities\n\nGuide Price\n1,150,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway\nTarmacadam drive, wheelchair ramp, plenty of parking space, mature trees and shrubs. \n\nEntrance Hallway (5.48m 2.1m) + (2.56m x 2.26m)\nWood flooring, alarm panel, two light fittings, under stair storage and storage cupboard (2.22m x 2.20m). \n\nLiving Room 3.96m x 6.05m\nCarpet, stone fireplace with kerosene stove, built in book shelf and light fitting. \n \nKitchen/Dining 3.52m x 6.87m\nLino covering, wall and floor units, stainless steel sink, light fittings, curtains, blinds, opening into the living room, window overlooking rear garden and door leading into utility room. \n\nUtility Room 1.42m x 3.25m\nFully plumbed, fitted wall and floor units, stainless steel sink, door leading to rear garden and light fitting. \n\n\nBedroom 4 (Ground Floor) 3.13m x 3m\nOverlooks front\nLaminate wood flooring, curtains, blinds and light shade. \n\nStudy/Playroom 3.13m x 3.14m\nOverlooks back \nLaminate wood flooring, curtains, blinds and light shade.\n\nBathroom 1.7m x 2.84m\nTiled floor, wet room shower area with shower curtin and electric shower, w.c., w.h.b., shaving light and light fiting.\n\nLanding 3.58m x 1.36m\nTongue & groove wood flooring, hot-press and light fitting. \n\nMaster Bedroom 3.96m x 4.92m \nFirst Floor, Overlooks front.\nTongue & groove wood flooring, curtains and hanging pendant light. \n\nWalk-In-Wardrobe (1.33m x 2.75m) + (2.05m x 1m) \nTongue & groove wood flooring and light fitting.\n\nBedroom 2 4.48m x 3.05m\nFirst Floor, Overlooks back \nTongue & groove wood flooring, blinds, hanging pendant light. \n\nWalk-In-Wardrobe 1.7m x 0.91m\nTongue & groove wood flooring and light fitting. \n\nAttic Storage Room 3.2m x 4.85m\nWindow and light fitting. \n\nBedroom 3 3.58m x 3.16m\nFirst Floor and overlooks back and side\nTongue & groove wood, blinds, hanging pendant light, window overlooking back and side.\n\nGarden \nPatio area, access to sheds and yard.\n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 195 sq.m\nTotal land area approx. 19.5 acres\nBuilt in 2002\nSandstone cladding and dashed exterior finish\nLarge block built shed (approx. 4.26m x 16.2m) \nSteel frame shed (approx. 14m x 7.3m) \n\nItems Included in sale:\nLight fittings, curtains, blinds.\n\n\nServices\nMains water \nOil fired central heating \n\nBER \nC1\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W23 Y16A\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nMick Wright \n016288400\n\n\n \n"
